    "detailed_description": "Basketball like never before in VR!<br><br>Shoot hoops and experience a whole new dimension of basketball in this quirky VR basketball game.<br><br>See yourself in real time on the jumbo screen and experience the excitement as the crowd jumps at your amazing ball shooting skills.<br><br>Practice and hone your talents on the court on the regulation basketball size court, score three pointers like never before. <br><br>So jump in, relax and enjoy a game of basketball in VR.<br><br>This game supports HTC Vive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong><u>Features</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Full Regulation Size Basket Ball Court</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Cheer Leaders</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Jumbo Screen</ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\">Arcade Mode</ul>",
